  "notes": "Original UK release in fully-laminated cover, with black & white photo on the front and red lettering, yellow background on rear and spine.\nA1/B1 runouts.\nBlack inner sleeve.\n\n℗ & © 1977 Stiff Records Ltd.\n\nOn labels:\n• Stiff Records • Electrically Recorded • The world's most flexible label • All Stereo [side A] • King Stereo [side B].\n• All songs by Elvis Costello\n• Title appears in quotation marks.\n\nOn back cover:\n• Manufactured and distributed by Island Records Ltd., 22, St. Peter's Square, London, W6\n• Stiff Records 32 Alexander Street London W2 S Ssurfing On The New Wave\n\nThis is one of the numerous early UK cover variants with different colored backs and Island Records Ltd. manufacturer/distributer credits. For the full list refer to the Master Release: [m=39488].\n\nRunouts are etched, except for the stamped '1' at approx. 3 o'clock.",
